### Register user
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "sam@gmail.com",
    "password": "qwerty",
    "firstname": "sam",
    "lastname": "sam",
    "role": "user"
}

### Login user
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "sam@gmail.com",
    "password": "qwerty"
}

